gftdocjp, cloud-itonami and com-junkawasaki, assign every path a disposition,
and migrate dependency-ordered pilots before widening the rollout. Each pilot
must prove source compilation, runtime behavior, negative safety cases and
rollback using installed artifacts. Consumer cutover stays false until those
gates pass.

